  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Fca Us recorded $512M in contract obligations in FY2026 to date. Fca Us received 11,836 awards so far this fiscal year, with an average award size of $43.3K. Obligations are up 101.5% year over year. Fiscal-year obligations have varied: FY21 shows $267M, FY22 shows $16.1M, FY23 shows $356M, FY24 shows $330M, FY25 shows $254M, and FY26 shows $512M. The FY2026 total is a partial fiscal-year-to-date figure. All figures are contract obligations except award-value figures in the largest-awards and expiring-contracts tables, which are total contract values. Current-year totals are partial (fiscal year to date). This summary focuses on award counts, average award size, and fiscal-year obligations to give a clear, factual picture of Fca Us’s federal contracting activity through FY2026 to date.",
